<title>SWEDEN: SOCCER-GOTHENBURG V PORTO TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GOTHENBURG V PORTO TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>GOTHENBURG, Sweden 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for Wednesday's European Cup Champions' League group D match between IFK Gothenburg of Sweden and Portugal's FC Porto:</p>
<p>Gothenburg: 1-Thomas Ravelli; 4-Jonas Olsson, 6-Teddy Lucic, 8-Peter Eriksson, 10-Stefan Pettersson; 11-Stefan Lindqvist, 13-Mikael Nilsson, 14-Andreas Andersson, 16-Jesper Blomqvist; 19-Magnus Erlingmark, 22-Stefan Landberg.</p>
<p>FC Porto: 24-Hilario; 4-Aloisio, 5-Fernando Mendes, 7-Sergio Conceicao, 11-Ljubinko Drulovic; 16-Jardel, 17-Barroso 19-Joao Mauel Pinto, 20-Paulinho Santos; 21-Edmilson, 25-Zlatko Zahovic.</p>
</text>
